@prefix hpc: <http://example.org/hpc#>
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#>

hpc:Command a owl:Class.
hpc:Cluster a owl:Class.
hpc:Component a owl:Class.

hpc:hascommand a owl:ObjectProperty.
hpc:oncluster a owl:ObjectProperty.
hpc:haspartition a owl:DatatypeProperty.

hpc:Command rdfs:subClassOf owl:Class.
hpc:Cluster rdfs:subClassOf owl:Class.
hpc:Component rdfs:subClassOf owl:Class.

hpc:Hascommand rdfs:domain hpc:Job.
hpc:Oncluster rdfs:domain hpc:Job.
